msgid "---"
msgstr ""
"## v1.1.0\n"
"\n"
"### New Features\n"
"- Added support for importing and exporting project files, making it easy to migrate and back up projects.\n"
"- Added a dark theme mode to reduce eye strain during prolonged use.\n"
"- Added a quick search feature to help you quickly locate specific content within the project.\n"
"- Added a new chart type: radar chart, to meet more diverse data visualization needs.\n"
"\n"
"### Optimizations\n"
"- Optimized the startup speed of the application, reducing the wait time.\n"
"- Improved the rendering performance of charts, making the display smoother.\n"
"- Refined the user interface details to enhance the overall user experience.\n"
"- Enhanced the stability of data synchronization to prevent data loss.\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where the application might crash when opening certain specific files.\n"
"- Fixed a bug where the chart data was not updated in a timely manner after editing.\n"
"- Fixed a display issue with the interface under certain screen resolutions.\n"
"- Fixed a problem where the export function failed when the file name contained special characters.\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- On some older operating systems, the dark theme may not display correctly.\n"
"- The radar chart feature is not yet fully compatible with all data formats.\n"

